# home_manager — project context

Read `.cursor/notes.md` before changing platform, storage, or distribution.

## Overview

Personal Flutter **Web** app: electricity/water bills, expenses, shopping list, bill photos. Install on iPhone via Safari Add to Home Screen. No App Store, no Developer Mode.

## Repo

- Package: `home_manager`
- Org: `com.pcn`
- Remote: `https://github.com/PhamChiNang151020/home-manager.git` (private)
- Branch: `main`
- Path: `/Users/be011/Desktop/PCN/scr/client/home-manager` (sibling of `flutter_sdk_switcher`)

## Structure (target)

- `lib/core/` — models + services (storage, backup); no UI imports
- `lib/features/` — screens and widgets
- `lib/app.dart` — app shell when split from `main.dart`
- `web/` — PWA manifest and icons

## Rules

1. Web-only in v1 — do not add iOS/Android platforms without approval.
2. Local-first storage (Hive). No cloud unless the user asks.
3. Persistence stays in services, not widgets.
4. Keep diffs small; match `flutter_lints` / `analysis_options.yaml`.
5. Do not commit secrets, `.env` keys, or personal bill data/photos.

## Build

```bash
flutter pub get
flutter run -d chrome
flutter build web
```

Develop with Flutter **3.29.2** (Dart 3.7.2 per `pubspec.yaml`).
